Engine DLL License Notice
==========================

The following pre-built binary DLLs in the `Engine/` directory are
proprietary components of AnXin Security. They are licensed under the
same MIT License as the main project, provided that they are used
solely as integral parts of the AnXin Security application.
Redistribution, reverse engineering, or standalone use of these DLLs
outside the context of AnXin Security is not permitted without
explicit written permission.

- **Raven Engine** (`Engine/Raven/raven_engine.dll`)

Third-party open-source libraries linked into or distributed alongside
these DLLs are governed by their respective licenses. See
`Engine/THIRD-PARTY` for full attribution details.

Other Engine Components
=======================

- **Axon Engine** — Now open-source under Apache 2.0 at
  https://github.com/kelomina/Axon_ML
- **Signature Engine** — Previously shipped as a separate DLL, now
  integrated into the Rust backend (`src-tauri/`) and is not open
  source.